A cyberpunk-style digital illustration depicting a solitary programmer seated at a curved, holographic workstation in a neon-drenched room. The workspace is split into two distinct holographic panels floating in mid-air—one showing cascading lines of glowing code in electric blue, the other displaying a grid of pulsing red and green diagnostic nodes connected by intricate circuitry patterns. The programmer wears a sleek neural headset, fingers dancing through the light. Behind them, towering server monoliths stretch into darkness, wrapped in glowing cables like technological vines. Rain streams down massive windows revealing a dystopian cityscape of endless towers. The color palette emphasizes deep purples, hot magentas, and cool cyans, with the split-screen workspace casting dramatic shadows across the figure's focused face.
